OL,3,GNEWSAStroke survivor's plea after
OL,4,A#60,000 care bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double stroke survivor and his wife
OL,7,Fhave spent more than #60,000 of their
OL,8,Fsavings on care and say they have been
OL,9,Fpunished for working and saving all
OL,10,Ftheir lives.
OL,12,FFormer gamekeeper and farmer George
OL,13,FCooke, 85, collapsed last year at his
OL,14,Fhome in Flagg, Derbyshire, and has been
OL,15,Fleft bed bound, with limited speech and
OL,16,Fno use of one arm.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
