OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAStroke survivor's plea after
OL,4,A#60,000 care bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis wife Jean, 85, disclosed their
OL,7,Fsavings to Derbyshire County Council
OL,8,F(DCC) who assessed them to be
OL,9,Fineligible for financial support and
OL,10,Fthe couple are now asking for reform to
OL,11,Fthe social care system.
OL,13,FCouncillor Joss Barnes said: "Who pays
OL,14,Ffor care in this country is a wider
OL,15,Fnational issue and I'll be interested
OL,16,Fto see how the government is going to
OL,17,Fsolve it."
